The [[Indestructible Golem]] is [[Oola]]'s creation and her last line of defense before the heroes reach her lab. It cannot take damage from most sources because of [[Temporal Sheen]]. To defeat the Indestructible Golem, pick up the nearby [[Flux Matrix]], charge it at the [[Unstable Magical Energy Storage]], and drop it near the Golem. The Golem will take significant damage; repeat this until it is destroyed.

