==Notes==
*The golem has an aggro bubble of spirit range, and will pull a full compass range from its spawn point.
*The golem does not regenerate health.
*The golem is immune to damage and degeneration, but is vulnerable to life steal and direct health loss, and can have its health lowered by a [[Deep Wound]].

